# Edit an existing Macro: inspect all three domains and return without edits.
# Purpose: inspect an existing Macro's three domains and return without edits.
# Static fixture keeps the pixels comparable across retained tab transitions.
# Expect: capture_changed:destination=automation, capture_changed:automation=modulation
# Expect: capture_equal:automation=automation_return, capture_equal:destination=destination_return
0 scenario macro-multi-modulation
180 button LEFT_BOTTOM down
260 tap MACRO_1 60
1300 button LEFT_BOTTOM up
1390 capture screen destination
1450 encoder NAV 0.010
1530 capture screen automation
1600 encoder NAV 0.010
1680 capture screen modulation
1760 encoder NAV -0.010
1840 capture screen automation_return
1920 encoder NAV -0.010
2000 capture screen destination_return
2080 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2250 capture screen performance_return
